        <title type="html"><![CDATA[Add Chrome DevTools Extensibility API]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/28270</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/28270"/>
        <updated>2025-10-28T16:30:27.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10931297?u=600cfcb4c4e709dfbc66b328147d846ee87b1e51&v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/>
<h4 dir="auto">Summary</h4>

<p dir="auto">The <a href="https://developer.chrome.com/docs/devtools/performance/extension" rel="nofollow">Chrome DevTools extensibility API</a> adds some optional extra params to User Timing (<code class="notranslate">performance.mark</code> and <code class="notranslate">performance.measure</code>) and <code class="notranslate">console.timestamp</code> to provide additional information to performance traces.</p>
<p dir="auto">I\m looking to document these in <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3477707185" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/41372" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/content/pull/41372/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/41372">mdn/content#41372</a> and so adding BCD data here.</p>
<h4 dir="auto">Test results and supporting details</h4>


<p dir="auto">User Timing supported from 128 - <a href="https://developer.chrome.com/blog/new-in-devtools-128#perf-extension" rel="nofollow">https://developer.chrome.com/blog/new-in-devtools-128#perf-extension</a><br>
Console.timesstamp supported from 134 <a href="https://developer.chrome.com/blog/new-in-devtools-134#console-timestamp" rel="nofollow">https://developer.chrome.com/blog/new-in-devtools-134#console-timestamp</a></p>
<p dir="auto">Spec discussions:</p>
<ul dir="auto">
<li>User Timing - <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="2432462953" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/w3c/user-timing/issues/111" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/w3c/user-timing/issues/111/hovercard" href="https://github.com/w3c/user-timing/issues/111">w3c/user-timing#111</a></li>
<li>Console.timesstamp - bocked on <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="326774211" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/whatwg/console/issues/140" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/whatwg/console/issues/140/hovercard" href="https://github.com/whatwg/console/issues/140">whatwg/console#140</a></li>
</ul>
<p dir="auto">Note I've marked it as <code class="notranslate">"standard_track": false</code> for now, since those discussions are ongoing.</p>
<h4 dir="auto">Related issues</h4>

<p dir="auto">MDN content PR: <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3477707185" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/41372" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/content/pull/41372/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/41372">mdn/content#41372</a></p>
]]></content>
